        Release(version: "0.63", date: "5 Oct 2026", title: "Arrange a template",
                new: ["Arrange your templates: on a template, tap Arrange, then hold \u{2261} and drag a heading (its things come along) or a thing to where it belongs \u{2014} even under another heading. Tap a heading's name to rename it or remove it; its things stay. New trips pack in the new order."]),
        Release(version: "0.62", date: "5 Oct 2026", title: "The big check-up: everything we found, put right",
                new: ["Your choices: the pen beside each entry renames it \u{2014} everything that said the old name follows \u{2014} and the arrows move it up or down (owners stay A to Z).",
                      "A thing's page: a Care schedule with what to do, your places a tap away under Kept at home, and \u{201C}No bag\u{201D} under Usually packed in.",
                      "A thing's page shows, under Notes, what your templates say about it \u{2014} \u{201C}On the Swim template: \u{2026}\u{201D}.",
                      "A template's page can move it to another activity area.",
                      "Trip settings: Pack weather gear anyway \u{2014} Rain, Cold, Heat, Wind or Snow.",
                      "Settings says when you last saved a backup on this device, and where your library came from.",
                      "To do and To buy: a line taken off with \u{2715} can be brought back with Undo."],
                changed: ["A new look: Apple's standard text sizes and slim buttons throughout \u{2014} calmer and more compact, with more on every screen. A trip's rows, tick circles and the grab-list buttons are smaller, Your things and Search show a thing's name and details on one line, and on the Mac everything is Mac-sized.",
                          "A thing's note stays the thing's: on a template it shows on every row and follows the thing when you change it.",
                          "Changes saved on a template's row \u{2014} bag, When, how many, note, \u{201C}Only on\u{201D} \u{2014} reach your trips still ahead, as changes to the thing do.",
                          "Choose from your things: what you tick arrives in the order you ticked it.",
                          "A name you already have is never added twice \u{2014} on a template, in Your things, in Grab Lists and in Your choices it says so instead.",
                          "A shared template with a name you already have asks for a name of its own. Replace keeps your template's look, sections and bags, and says first what comes in and what leaves.",
                          "Template cards say \u{201C}Next: in 30 days\u{201D} for a trip still to come.",
                          "Sharing a trip sends just the list: your \u{201C}not this time\u{201D} marks, notes and scale readings stay with you. A trip someone sends you keeps its whole list when you change its settings.",
                          "A new trip started from an old one begins clean, and setting something aside takes its tick away \u{2014} so the review and Your year count only what really went.",
                          "Every bag on a trip shows on Bags, even before anything is weighed: tap it to weigh.",
                          "Templates without an activity area can go on a trip, under Other templates. Weather suggestions skip things not in use.",
                          "The calendar keeps one height, and tapping the date box waits for the last day. Trip dates read \u{201C}3 Oct 2026\u{201D} everywhere.",
                          "A swipe no longer loses an unsaved review or unsaved trip settings. On the Mac, Escape closes a trip's windows.",
                          "All your things offers your own bags and every owner. The table has no Bags column any more \u{2014} bags live in Your bags.",
                          "Change all says what it changed and refuses a weight that is not a number; Undo puts back only what Change all changed.",
                          "A condition chosen in the table, like Needs replacing, counts everywhere \u{2014} To buy offers it. Things set that way earlier are put right by themselves.",
                          "Care also lists things that are on no template, leaves out things not in use, and the year ahead counts real months.",
                          "To buy and Reminders stay in step: removing or unticking a line does the same in Reminders, and a line deleted there can be sent again.",
                          "Grab lists: saving keeps today's ticks, Start over sets the sometimes-things aside again, and a waiting list in Grab Lists opens with a tap.",
                          "Your choices: why something cannot be removed appears right under it, and says what still uses it.",
                          "The iCloud card says \u{201C}Can't tell\u{201D} when it cannot check, instead of a green \u{201C}Working\u{201D}.",
                          "The notes for each new version now show in TestFlight as What to Test.",
                          "On the Mac, Escape closes every window the way its Cancel or Done does, and never saves by accident; on an iPhone with a keyboard, Command-period does the same.",
                          "Your choices: Owners shows the owners your things already belong to, even if you never added one yourself.",
                          "Remind me to pack: when this device does not allow reminders, Settings says so every time, whether the switch is on or off.",
                          "Closing the restore window by swiping it away says \u{201C}Nothing was replaced.\u{201D}, as Cancel does."],
                fixed: ["On a new, empty device, Sync no longer hides the welcome doors. Cancel after looking inside a backup changes nothing; safety copies show your own clock time; the Restore window fits the iPhone.",
                        "Bringing back an older backup puts each thing's own note and amount back, and pictures saved slightly irregularly come back too.",
                        "A grab list deleted on your other device closes instead of turning into another one. A Shortcut, the Action button or a reminder opens its list even when another window is open.",
                        "A to-do found in Search opens the To do tab; Home's Templates number matches Your templates.",
                        "Remind me to pack says so when the iPhone does not allow reminders, and names every reminder day.",
                        "To do and To buy each keep their own half-typed line. Weights take decimals, like 12,5.",
                        "Your bags shows a number changed on a bag's page straight away, and a bag's Delete says what to choose first.",
                        "Buying something on site puts the trip at On site in the loop too; the way home shows photos of things in no bag.",
                        "\u{201C}No template\u{201D} works in the review; Set place and the review's Add say what is missing.",
                        "Deleting a template also removes its filter and its column in the table, and the table sorts å, ä and ö like everywhere else.",
